2026-07-27T07:49:50.0566798Z i /tmp/Rtmpr6MaRg/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:49:50.0567127Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:49:50.0567493Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:49:50.0568201Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:49:50.0568917Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:49:50.0569716Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:49:50.0570253Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
